llow-up messages within the 5-minute TTL will read the static instructions from cache (~780 tokens at ~10% price)\n- Memory writes (`save_fact`) will only re-cache the volatile tail (~240 tokens) instead of the full ~1000+ tokens\n- The `logs/usage.jsonl` should show `cache_read_input_tokens` covering the static block even after memory writes, with `cache_creation_input_tokens` only for the volatile tail","numLines":53,"startLine":1,"requestedOffset":null,"requestedLimit":2000,"totalLines":null,"wasTruncated":false},"display":{"success":true,"verb":"Read","message":"53 lines from ANSWER.md","warnings":[],"approvalNote":null,"suffix":""}}}
